              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "width": 420,
              "height": 48,
              "content": "Web runtime: visibility/focus/ad pause · WebGL loss/recovery · audio unlock · storage quotas · origin-safe iframe messaging · tested browser/host matrix. Editor UI and game UI remain separate.",
